  "title": "Instant Pot® Zuppa Toscana",
  "description": "Throw together a delicious zuppa toscana dinner quickly and easily by adding Italian sausage, seasoning, potatoes, and kale to an Instant Pot® and letting it do the work for you.",
  "authors": [
    "Maureen Martindale VanHook"
